        "line1": "<span class=\"fontsize-2vw\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Defying the odds<br>\r\n</span>Lin’s battle with colon cancer</span>",
        "line2": "<p><br>\r\nWhen Lin was diagnosed with&nbsp;stage 3 colon cancer, he was told he only had 6 months to live.</p>\r\n<p>Learn how a trusting relationship with a doctor, the right technology, and the support of his family&nbsp;helped guide him to remission.</p>\r\n",
